WEBVTT

01:37.570 --> 01:42.920
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.550 --> 01:46.000
[Episode 11]

01:58.680 --> 01:59.740
What are you doing?

02:01.510 --> 02:02.350
Master.

02:04.400 --> 02:05.680
I now know I was wrong.

02:09.750 --> 02:11.410
Everything that has happened

02:11.870 --> 02:12.870
is all my fault.

02:14.710 --> 02:17.310
I shouldn't have disobeyed
my parents' orders

02:17.910 --> 02:20.370
and insisted on marrying you
as a concubine.

02:21.190 --> 02:22.920
I shouldn't have counted on you

02:23.150 --> 02:24.480
to shield the three of us

02:25.280 --> 02:26.540
from life's harships.

02:28.870 --> 02:30.190
It's all my fault.

02:32.750 --> 02:34.000
What do you mean?

02:35.240 --> 02:38.360
Are you saying you were

02:38.960 --> 02:40.750
blind to marry me?

02:43.630 --> 02:45.120
How dare you!

02:56.310 --> 02:57.360
Master.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.120
Master.

03:02.560 --> 03:06.150
No matter what,
Zhengjun is your own flesh and blood.

03:07.030 --> 03:09.160
Even if he’s made a thousand mistakes,

03:09.710 --> 03:10.910
you can't just stand by

03:10.910 --> 03:12.570
and watch him fend for himself

03:12.750 --> 03:14.150
in prison, can you?

03:15.310 --> 03:16.280
Concubine Mei.

03:16.910 --> 03:17.960
Mei Yinghua.

03:18.310 --> 03:20.180
Everyone in the residence knows

03:20.240 --> 03:21.700
that I dote on you the most.

03:23.150 --> 03:25.800
Otherwise, how would I put up with you

03:25.800 --> 03:27.460
causing trouble all the time?

03:30.800 --> 03:32.120
If I didn't care for

03:32.590 --> 03:33.840
that little brat,

03:34.280 --> 03:36.120
why would I personally go to the prison

03:36.120 --> 03:37.400
and give him 70 lashes?

03:39.630 --> 03:41.150
70 lashes?

03:41.910 --> 03:43.640
You might as well take his life!

03:45.150 --> 03:46.680
Such a narrow-minded view.

03:47.840 --> 03:49.450
If I didn't give him 70 lashes,

03:49.450 --> 03:50.910
would that guy surnamed Yan

03:50.910 --> 03:52.800
actually believe he was framed?

03:53.240 --> 03:54.430
I saved his life!

03:55.590 --> 03:56.800
70 lashes is already

03:57.240 --> 03:58.440
letting him off easy.

04:00.240 --> 04:00.970
I don't care.

04:01.630 --> 04:03.960
Either way, you must get him out of prison.

04:04.800 --> 04:06.520
If you don't save Zhengjun,

04:08.710 --> 04:10.370
I'll die right in front of you.

04:11.190 --> 04:11.960
Then die.

04:12.240 --> 04:13.910
Master!

04:22.120 --> 04:23.430
The Eldest Young Master is back!

04:23.430 --> 04:25.230
The Eldest Young Master is back!

04:25.600 --> 04:27.240
The Eldest Young Master is back!

04:27.240 --> 04:29.040
The Eldest Young Master is back!

04:30.310 --> 04:30.800
Mother!

04:32.370 --> 04:35.550
[Xie's Eldest Young Master, Xie Zhenglun]

04:34.680 --> 04:35.150
Mother!

04:55.510 --> 04:56.720
Get up.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.930
My son has grown taller.

05:08.480 --> 05:11.920
This is Zhenglun, the Eldest Brother
everyone talks about.

05:12.240 --> 05:14.500
I have been thinking about you every day.

05:21.270 --> 05:22.600
Zhengjun, he...

05:29.040 --> 05:29.510
Mother.

05:32.390 --> 05:33.150
I'm here.

05:35.360 --> 05:36.360
It seems

05:36.870 --> 05:38.870
he is Concubine Mei's weakness.

05:44.870 --> 05:46.120
Xie Shu

05:47.600 --> 05:51.260
wants me to take the fall for this
corruption charge all by myself.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.680
Yan Rui

05:54.420 --> 05:57.420
wants to use my life
in exchange for merits.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.510
Fine.

06:11.390 --> 06:12.630
Then we shall

06:14.630 --> 06:17.040
gamble our lives with them once more.

06:45.390 --> 06:46.630
Second Young Master,

06:46.920 --> 06:48.630
your time has come.

06:56.220 --> 06:56.870
Lord Yan!

06:56.870 --> 06:57.760
Save me!

06:58.630 --> 07:01.000
I have accepted Lord Wei's gift
on his behalf.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.240
As for Second Young Master Xie,

07:02.240 --> 07:03.500
you must not touch him.

07:29.160 --> 07:31.220
What else do you have up your sleeves?

08:46.400 --> 08:47.260
Don't kill him!

08:55.990 --> 08:58.790
[Shen Che]

09:08.030 --> 09:09.670
Here are the noodles you wanted.

09:09.670 --> 09:11.480
I made this for you myself.

09:11.870 --> 09:12.720
Eat up.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.920
Your skills have regressed.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.960
That's for sure.

09:20.630 --> 09:21.830
As a corrupt official

09:21.870 --> 09:23.600
living a life of pleasure and
leisure every day,

09:23.600 --> 09:26.060
my skills naturally can't compare to yours.

09:28.750 --> 09:30.550
You are all alone in the capital.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.840
It must have been hard on you.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.360
Eat slowly.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.460
Since you are back,

09:45.360 --> 09:47.420
why don't you stay for a few more days?

09:50.480 --> 09:52.080
I've prepared a room for you.

09:58.870 --> 10:00.530
I still have some things to do.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.120
After you finish eating,

10:02.120 --> 10:02.790
rest early.

10:15.670 --> 10:17.000
I recall ordering that

10:17.390 --> 10:18.970
during the lockdown of the Xie Residence,

10:18.970 --> 10:20.900
no one is allowed to enter or leave.

10:21.200 --> 10:21.840
Yes.

10:22.030 --> 10:24.490
Then thank you for doing me a favor,
Lord Yan.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.910
So you're relying on my authority
to throw your weight around now.

10:26.910 --> 10:27.600
Tell me.

10:28.030 --> 10:30.090
What brings you here so late at night?

10:31.720 --> 10:34.110
If you can't give me a convincing reason,

10:34.320 --> 10:36.850
I'll escort you back
to the residence myself.

10:39.600 --> 10:41.260
Since I left Chen's Tea House,

10:41.360 --> 10:42.670
it's been a long time since

10:42.670 --> 10:45.330
I had osmanthus candy with
such a strong flavor.

10:45.630 --> 10:47.000
Miss, don't tell me you

10:47.150 --> 10:49.240
went through all the trouble of
escaping from the residence

10:49.240 --> 10:50.840
just to trick me out of candy.

10:51.070 --> 10:52.070
What's up?

10:52.870 --> 10:54.000
You wanted to see me?

10:54.080 --> 10:54.600
Yes.

10:54.910 --> 10:55.640
I missed you.

10:59.510 --> 11:00.540
At the same time,

11:00.630 --> 11:02.490
I also want to tell you something.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.010
Lord Yan,

11:05.630 --> 11:07.290
can you withdraw your troops?

11:08.240 --> 11:09.480
What a letdown.

11:09.870 --> 11:11.480
I put on such a big show

11:11.790 --> 11:13.720
just to be able to see you every day.

11:14.390 --> 11:15.720
If I withdraw my troops,

11:16.120 --> 11:18.250
wouldn't that put me far away from you?

11:20.960 --> 11:29.790
♪ The immortal with green hair ♪

11:31.990 --> 11:39.790
♪ Lazy and flirtatious ♪

11:40.240 --> 11:40.990
What's wrong?

11:40.990 --> 11:45.210
♪ Drinking toasts ♪

11:43.120 --> 11:44.000
Xie Shu said

11:45.200 --> 11:47.200
that the first time he met my mother,

11:49.030 --> 11:50.830
she was singing Tale of the Pipa.

11:59.000 --> 12:00.630
The way her water sleeves danced

11:59.390 --> 12:05.380
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

12:02.390 --> 12:04.250
looked exactly like a butterfly.

12:05.530 --> 12:11.510
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

12:11.150 --> 12:12.030
Unfortunately,

12:11.610 --> 12:16.900
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

12:13.790 --> 12:15.920
I've never heard my mother sing opera.

12:16.960 --> 12:23.020
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

12:19.720 --> 12:21.150
I wonder if it's really

12:22.390 --> 12:23.840
as beautiful as he described.

12:23.090 --> 12:29.280
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

12:28.000 --> 12:29.270
My mother once said

12:29.310 --> 12:35.570
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

12:30.390 --> 12:33.390
she also yearned for an unwavering love.

12:35.670 --> 12:41.960
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

12:35.840 --> 12:37.790
But ever since I can remember,

12:39.870 --> 12:41.800
she had became a different person.

12:41.980 --> 12:47.880
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

12:43.360 --> 12:44.820
She stopped singing opera

12:47.480 --> 12:48.600
and no longer had any desires.

12:47.900 --> 12:54.070
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

12:54.090 --> 13:00.190
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

12:57.030 --> 12:58.160
In this inner court,

12:59.080 --> 13:00.360
there lived so many women.

13:00.210 --> 13:06.430
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
oflife and death ♪

13:02.240 --> 13:05.750
My mother was just one of them.

13:06.450 --> 13:12.130
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

13:17.120 --> 13:18.030
Her smiles,

13:19.240 --> 13:20.120
her tears,

13:22.840 --> 13:23.870
her dreams,

13:25.960 --> 13:27.120
has been buried in

13:30.510 --> 13:31.910
this inner courtyard.

13:41.070 --> 13:46.680
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

13:44.960 --> 13:45.760
Xie Qingyuan.

13:46.770 --> 13:52.690
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

13:52.030 --> 13:53.510
Have you ever loved a woman?

13:52.750 --> 13:58.270
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

13:58.350 --> 14:04.380
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

14:01.200 --> 14:02.860
What kind of question is that?

14:04.450 --> 14:10.520
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

14:04.750 --> 14:06.030
I just want to know

14:07.030 --> 14:08.490
under what circumstances

14:08.630 --> 14:10.440
a man would give up

14:10.680 --> 14:16.820
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

14:11.630 --> 14:13.390
the woman he loves.

14:16.890 --> 14:23.250
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

14:22.910 --> 14:24.030
In order to protect her.

14:23.270 --> 14:29.630
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

14:29.660 --> 14:35.810
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

14:33.240 --> 14:34.640
Let my Second Brother go.

14:35.840 --> 14:42.110
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

14:39.320 --> 14:40.000
Yan Rui.

14:40.750 --> 14:42.030
You clearly know

14:42.140 --> 14:48.200
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
oflife and death ♪

14:42.670 --> 14:45.320
that my Second Brother is simply

14:45.670 --> 14:47.800
the most insignificant little shrimp

14:48.230 --> 14:53.900
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

14:48.750 --> 14:50.610
in this murky waters of Hengtang.

14:52.240 --> 14:53.440
What you want to catch

14:53.930 --> 15:00.110
♪ The wind blows away old memories,
piling them in heaps before the door ♪

14:54.360 --> 14:56.220
is the big fish behind him, right?

14:59.270 --> 15:00.000
Am I right?

15:00.130 --> 15:06.110
♪ No one speaks for anyone else ♪

15:06.350 --> 15:12.150
♪ Which page is a missed opportunity,
and which holds my hopes? ♪

15:13.960 --> 15:14.790
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

15:17.720 --> 15:18.870
His Lordship has ordered

15:18.870 --> 15:20.130
to withdraw the guards

15:20.150 --> 15:20.810
and return.

15:21.350 --> 15:22.690
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

15:21.390 --> 15:22.080
Yes, Sir!

15:23.910 --> 15:25.390
Thank you, Lord Yan.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.440
Zhenglun.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.550
Yes.

15:29.200 --> 15:31.600
Take your brother to rest and recover.

15:33.390 --> 15:34.120
Yes, Father.

15:42.870 --> 15:44.930
A trip to the Criminal Justice Office

15:45.480 --> 15:47.440
has taken a heavy toll on him.

15:48.270 --> 15:50.750
Second Brother cares most about
preserving his reputation.

15:50.750 --> 15:53.150
When has he ever been subject to
such injustice?

15:53.150 --> 15:56.440
Second Young Master Xie was the victim of
an assassination attempt yesterday.

15:56.440 --> 15:58.700
It looks like he is still a little shaken.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.240
Lord Xie,

16:00.630 --> 16:03.430
please prepare some
calming herbal soups for him.

16:03.480 --> 16:05.450
Did you say... assassination?

16:06.080 --> 16:07.010
What do you mean?

16:10.510 --> 16:13.220
I suppose since the case is
about to be solved,

16:13.670 --> 16:15.670
someone wanted to make a 
last-ditch attempt.

16:15.670 --> 16:17.200
But rest assured, Lord Xie.

16:17.390 --> 16:18.320
Your son is fine.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.870
He only suffered some minor injuries

16:20.870 --> 16:22.130
and a little hardship.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.840
The hardship...

16:25.240 --> 16:27.080
is also his own fault.

16:28.480 --> 16:29.030
Indeed.

16:30.270 --> 16:32.390
Second Young Master is young and ignorant.

16:32.390 --> 16:34.190
He fell for Guo Baofeng's tricks

16:34.790 --> 16:36.920
and resold the disaster relief grain.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.220
Although he is guilty,

16:38.670 --> 16:40.720
fortunately he is not the mastermind.

16:40.720 --> 16:43.050
Besides, the money has been compensated.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.000
So for this case...

16:44.000 --> 16:44.870
Lord Yan.

16:47.150 --> 16:49.050
The tea beside you

16:50.440 --> 16:54.120
is lotus seed tea prepared by
my daughter Qingyuan herself.

16:56.440 --> 16:58.210
It clears inner heat

16:58.630 --> 16:59.890
and relieves worries.

17:00.550 --> 17:02.160
Please have a taste.

17:28.109 --> 17:29.710
The tea brewed by Fourth Lady

17:29.720 --> 17:30.960
is indeed delicious.

17:35.400 --> 17:36.660
Since that's the case,

17:37.640 --> 17:39.900
how about closing the case after autumn?

17:41.510 --> 17:43.350
That way, everyone will be happy.

17:43.350 --> 17:44.740
Sounds great.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.400
Thank you.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.110
No need to thank me.

17:48.480 --> 17:50.140
You should thank Fourth Lady.

17:50.400 --> 17:53.680
If she hadn't persuaded me
with her eloquence,

17:55.480 --> 17:56.880
I don't think this matter

17:57.160 --> 17:59.160
would have been settled so quickly.

18:04.680 --> 18:06.200
In that case,

18:06.310 --> 18:08.350
I owe the greatest thanks to myself

18:09.880 --> 18:13.680
for having such a wonderful daughter.

18:19.510 --> 18:20.440
Qingyuan.

18:21.590 --> 18:22.680
Lord Yan

18:23.200 --> 18:25.030
is generous and righteous.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.640
You should pick a day

18:26.720 --> 18:28.000
to visit the Yan residence

18:28.000 --> 18:30.480
and formally thank him in person.

18:32.240 --> 18:32.920
Yes.

18:33.640 --> 18:34.240
Indeed.

18:34.920 --> 18:35.720
The Eighteen Scholars Camellias

18:35.720 --> 18:36.750
at my residence

18:38.240 --> 18:39.770
are blooming beautifully.

18:40.030 --> 18:41.270
Please stop by whenever

18:41.270 --> 18:42.600
you have some free time.

18:43.240 --> 18:44.030
Yes.

18:59.590 --> 19:00.400
Yes.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.790
I, Xie Shu, stand ready to
receive the decree.

19:35.350 --> 19:36.640
It seems Lord Xie

19:37.110 --> 19:38.840
knew the Emperor would do this.

19:41.240 --> 19:43.000
Commissioner Hu's influence

19:43.960 --> 19:45.480
in the court

19:46.160 --> 19:48.090
is truly not to be underestimated.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.910
The Emperor's grace is vast.

19:50.270 --> 19:52.310
I am deeply grateful.

20:05.510 --> 20:07.840
Since the Emperor trusts Lord Xie so much,

20:08.590 --> 20:11.720
I'm sure you will not disappoint him

20:11.960 --> 20:13.960
and resolve the disaster relief efforts.

20:13.960 --> 20:17.960
The corruption and famine in Hengtang
are about to be resolved.

20:19.030 --> 20:21.640
I hope Lord Xie can lend a hand

20:25.240 --> 20:26.240
and help me out.

20:29.070 --> 20:29.880
Of course.

20:31.310 --> 20:32.310
No problem at all.

20:46.840 --> 20:49.180
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

20:48.030 --> 20:48.590
Father.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.110
What are you doing?

20:53.870 --> 20:55.770
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

20:56.030 --> 20:57.880
Second Brother has already been punished
for his mistakes.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.480
My mother simply loves her son dearly

20:59.480 --> 21:01.640
and didn't mean to be disrespectful to you.

21:01.640 --> 21:03.400
Please lift the detention order.

21:03.400 --> 21:04.160
Zhengjun...

21:05.310 --> 21:06.750
still needs his mother's care.

21:06.750 --> 21:09.880
Are there not enough maids and nannies
in the residence?

21:10.550 --> 21:13.120
Do you really need that
good-for-nothing mother of yours

21:13.120 --> 21:14.950
to take care of the injured?

21:15.880 --> 21:18.280
My mother has been prideful her whole life.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.660
It's really pitiful to

21:19.920 --> 21:20.980
treat her this way.

21:21.350 --> 21:22.350
Pitiful?

21:23.160 --> 21:24.760
She brought it upon herself.

21:25.270 --> 21:27.170
Only a fool like you

21:27.480 --> 21:29.280
would be fooled by her tears.

21:29.590 --> 21:31.160
When I was in the Northern Frontier,

21:31.160 --> 21:32.760
how many times did I tell you?

21:33.000 --> 21:34.310
A man

21:35.070 --> 21:36.530
must not be soft-hearted.

21:38.830 --> 21:40.550
We have guests in the residence.

21:40.550 --> 21:42.240
Lord Yan will head out soon.

21:42.440 --> 21:44.830
How would it look if he saw you
kneeling here?

21:44.830 --> 21:47.350
Are you trying to embarrass me?

21:47.960 --> 21:48.890
I wouldn't dare.

21:49.160 --> 21:49.640
Get up.

21:57.440 --> 22:00.240
The Fourth Lady has always
been bold and reckless.

22:00.510 --> 22:01.310
Just now,

22:02.200 --> 22:05.200
you even dared to eavesdrop on
the Emperor's secrets.

22:06.110 --> 22:08.710
You knew I was here
but you didn't say anything.

22:09.240 --> 22:11.200
That means you tacitly
allowed me to listen in,

22:11.200 --> 22:12.730
so it's not eavesdropping.

22:13.640 --> 22:15.440
You are just twisting the truth.

22:16.070 --> 22:18.000
I really didn't mean to eavesdrop.

22:18.030 --> 22:19.640
I came to inform Your Lordship

22:19.640 --> 22:21.680
that your personal belongings
have been loaded onto the carriage.

22:21.680 --> 22:23.080
You can leave at any time.

22:24.790 --> 22:25.440
What?

22:26.000 --> 22:27.000
Burning bridges?

22:28.070 --> 22:29.790
So eager to kick me out?

22:31.110 --> 22:33.680
Who was the one who cited laws one by one

22:34.350 --> 22:35.640
just to make me stay?

22:37.070 --> 22:37.930
Your Lordship,

22:38.160 --> 22:39.890
shouldn't you be magnanimous?

22:41.070 --> 22:43.070
Why bicker with a weak woman like me?

22:44.550 --> 22:45.750
I am not magnanimous.

22:47.350 --> 22:50.010
I'm the kind of person who
nitpicks everything.

22:52.310 --> 22:54.240
Then what do you want, Your Lordship?

22:54.240 --> 22:55.350
Wait for my word.

22:55.960 --> 22:58.160
There will be times when I will need you.

23:13.310 --> 23:16.160
The notoginseng powder for
Yuanwai's Residence on the East Street?

23:16.160 --> 23:17.480
How dare you little brat even try to

23:17.480 --> 23:20.480
get involved in a deal worth
a hundred taels of silver?

23:22.270 --> 23:23.550
Can you tell the difference
between a 20-head

23:23.550 --> 23:24.880
and a 40-head?

23:27.790 --> 23:29.400
Wenshan panax notoginseng.

23:29.440 --> 23:31.570
The main root looks like a lion's head,

23:32.110 --> 23:33.820
and the cross-section
looks like a chrysanthemum.

23:33.820 --> 23:36.280
It's a shame they overdid it
with the sulfur.

23:36.310 --> 23:38.710
Even the copper scale pan has turned green.

23:48.310 --> 23:49.200
Fine.

23:49.370 --> 23:51.890
Since Fourth Lady knows these herbs,

23:52.310 --> 23:53.170
then do you know

23:53.240 --> 23:55.770
the difference between Qingbei and Songbei?

23:56.160 --> 23:57.070
You should know that

23:57.070 --> 23:58.480
one must not be careless with medicine.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.880
One wrong herb and it could mean...

23:59.880 --> 24:01.830
The ones with a crescent shape
in the middle are the highest grade,

24:01.830 --> 24:04.240
while those that vary greatly in size
are of the next grade.

24:04.240 --> 24:05.700
What's so hard about that?

24:05.920 --> 24:07.140
Just like how you

24:07.400 --> 24:09.750
delivered 5 taels of bird's nest
to the Xie Residence,

24:09.750 --> 24:11.210
but recorded it as 8 taels.

24:12.160 --> 24:14.230
Did you really think the fake bird's nests
made of rice paste

24:14.230 --> 24:15.580
would go unnoticed?

24:18.030 --> 24:21.490
The person recommended by
Second Madam Mei is indeed capable.

24:22.720 --> 24:24.680
Look at your fat face.

24:25.270 --> 24:26.270
You must have been

24:26.960 --> 24:29.000
feeding yourself with
all that extra profit, right?

24:29.000 --> 24:30.160
You are making baseless accusations!

24:30.160 --> 24:32.030
You all are making baseless accusations!

24:32.030 --> 24:34.350
Don't think just because you took over
this pharmacy from Second Madam,

24:34.350 --> 24:35.950
you can do whatever you want.

24:36.070 --> 24:38.160
Who doesn't know that you,
Fourth Lady Xie,

24:38.160 --> 24:40.560
have always been at odds with Second Madam?

24:41.680 --> 24:43.200
Baseless accusations?

24:43.680 --> 24:46.560
Do you really think
I'm a cold-hearted master?

24:47.790 --> 24:48.350
Come,

24:48.920 --> 24:50.220
listen up.

24:51.110 --> 24:53.310
Besides these substandard herbs,

24:53.310 --> 24:56.160
there's a drawer full of
fake donkey-hide gelatin.

24:56.160 --> 24:58.840
And on the third shelf of cabinet C
in the warehouse,

24:58.840 --> 25:00.070
12 bags of Sichuan pepper

25:00.070 --> 25:01.510
are waiting to be mixed with sawdust.

25:01.510 --> 25:02.790
Am I right?

25:04.240 --> 25:05.930
And your little grandson's

25:06.200 --> 25:08.000
tuition at the private academy
in the south of the city

25:08.000 --> 25:09.750
is paid from the Xie Residence's
public account, right?

25:09.750 --> 25:11.070
Who approved this?

25:12.680 --> 25:13.410
How dare you!

25:13.680 --> 25:15.110
So you're just here to cause trouble, huh?

25:15.110 --> 25:16.310
-I’ll…
-Guards!

25:22.080 --> 25:24.410
Hurry up, grab your employment contract,

25:25.030 --> 25:26.110
and get out of here!

25:31.200 --> 25:32.730
Bullying the outnumbered?

25:32.750 --> 25:33.740
Just you wait!

26:18.110 --> 26:19.160
My son.

26:21.350 --> 26:23.410
Your father has agreed to let you out.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.560
The Xie family is safe.

26:34.150 --> 26:35.880
As for this Fourth Lady,

26:36.250 --> 26:37.940
if you truly love her

26:38.240 --> 26:40.040
and refuse to marry anyone else,

26:41.270 --> 26:42.670
I won't stop you anymore.

26:44.000 --> 26:45.590
I just beg you not to

26:45.610 --> 26:47.670
torture yourself like this anymore.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.000
Okay.

26:52.440 --> 26:53.750
Go wash up and change your clothes.

26:53.750 --> 26:55.240
How can you go to see your loved one

26:55.240 --> 26:57.010
without looking your best?

27:03.790 --> 27:04.850
Thank you, Mother.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.410
Young Master Li.

27:22.030 --> 27:25.160
A few pearls have accidentally fallen off
the jade and pearl hairpin

27:25.160 --> 27:27.290
you left at the Xie Residence last time

27:27.480 --> 27:29.350
I have sent someone to repair it.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.640
When it is fixed,

27:30.760 --> 27:37.840
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

27:30.790 --> 27:33.070
I will send someone to
deliver it back to your residence.

27:33.070 --> 27:33.680
Why?

27:34.240 --> 27:35.840
Don't you like it, Qingyuan?

27:36.030 --> 27:36.590
Yes.

27:37.030 --> 27:37.890
I don't like it.

27:37.910 --> 27:44.620
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

27:44.800 --> 27:52.140
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

27:46.030 --> 27:47.590
By not liking it,

27:47.920 --> 27:49.960
I don't mean the hairpin is not good.

27:51.070 --> 27:52.720
It deserves a better owner

27:52.270 --> 27:59.320
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

27:53.110 --> 27:54.400
who will cherish it.

27:58.550 --> 27:59.960
Just like you, Young Master Li.

27:59.460 --> 28:06.630
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

28:00.960 --> 28:02.640
All the ladies in Hengtang

28:03.030 --> 28:05.490
say you are the best candidate
for a husband,

28:05.880 --> 28:07.030
because you are outstanding.

28:06.820 --> 28:16.650
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

28:08.240 --> 28:09.590
But to like someone,

28:09.960 --> 28:12.090
you don't need them to be outstanding.

28:12.200 --> 28:14.830
Just liking them is enough.

28:17.380 --> 28:24.390
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

28:22.830 --> 28:23.750
But I like you.

28:24.420 --> 28:31.420
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

28:24.550 --> 28:26.000
Since the Shangsi Festival,

28:26.000 --> 28:28.260
I have decided I will marry no one but you.

28:30.000 --> 28:31.110
Can you tell me why

28:31.400 --> 28:32.720
you are always trying to push me away?

28:31.450 --> 28:34.940
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

28:33.030 --> 28:34.400
Am I inadequate in any way

28:34.400 --> 28:35.270
that made you hate me?

28:34.970 --> 28:38.630
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

28:38.660 --> 28:44.930
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

28:40.440 --> 28:41.480
I don't hate you.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.480
But it doesn't mean

28:46.270 --> 28:48.070
that I will definitely like you.

28:51.200 --> 28:53.350
When it comes to interacting with others,

28:53.350 --> 28:55.880
isn’t being at ease
the most important thing?

28:56.720 --> 28:57.480
It's true.

28:58.480 --> 29:00.550
I am a concubine-born daughter
of the Xie family.

29:00.550 --> 29:01.880
After wandering in exile for many years,

29:00.650 --> 29:07.050
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

29:02.440 --> 29:04.030
I need to tread lightly

29:04.350 --> 29:06.550
just to survive in this house.

29:07.170 --> 29:13.890
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

29:07.400 --> 29:08.640
But Young Master Li,

29:09.400 --> 29:11.600
although I live in such an environment,

29:11.750 --> 29:14.030
it doesn't mean I need a man

29:14.060 --> 29:21.740
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

29:14.270 --> 29:16.550
or a marriage to save me.

29:17.440 --> 29:19.100
Do you understand what I mean?

29:21.910 --> 29:28.880
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

29:29.040 --> 29:36.350
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

29:36.430 --> 29:46.730
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

29:42.400 --> 29:44.000
Just like this beam of light,

29:45.200 --> 29:46.350
to me,

29:47.180 --> 29:54.100
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

29:51.160 --> 29:52.350
it means nothing.

29:54.220 --> 30:01.340
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

30:01.370 --> 30:04.740
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

30:01.440 --> 30:02.040
It's okay.

30:03.030 --> 30:04.630
I will always be by your side.

30:04.770 --> 30:08.430
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

30:08.520 --> 30:14.920
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

30:12.110 --> 30:12.830
Trust me,

30:13.310 --> 30:15.570
one day I'll let you see my true feelings.

30:19.330 --> 30:26.100
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

30:24.780 --> 30:32.260
[Frugality Cultivates Virtue]

30:26.250 --> 30:33.590
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

30:30.480 --> 30:32.000
Where were we?

30:32.510 --> 30:33.770
We were talking about the ledger.

30:33.770 --> 30:36.730
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

30:34.350 --> 30:35.550
Who is that?

30:36.510 --> 30:37.200
Who?

30:36.870 --> 30:40.300
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

30:39.550 --> 30:40.550
The two of them on the bridge.

30:40.430 --> 30:46.920
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

30:44.440 --> 30:46.300
The Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

30:47.070 --> 30:48.400
She's a knife in my hand.

30:53.590 --> 30:54.440
Fine.

30:55.830 --> 30:58.630
Just don't let the knife
cut your own hand instead.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.400
I know what I'm doing.

31:01.200 --> 31:02.130
It's no big deal.

31:03.200 --> 31:04.440
I won't let her

31:04.680 --> 31:06.110
get in the way of our plan.

31:07.270 --> 31:08.670
Don't you dare touch her.

31:14.480 --> 31:15.240
Yan.

31:15.680 --> 31:16.350
Dear.

31:16.590 --> 31:19.550
I prepared some candies for you.

31:19.550 --> 31:20.410
Take them home.

31:20.920 --> 31:22.680
This is sugar pastry.

31:22.880 --> 31:24.680
When there's sugar, there's joy

31:27.110 --> 31:28.680
This is lotus seed candy.

31:29.440 --> 31:31.160
More sons, more blessings.

31:37.350 --> 31:38.750
You two continue to chat.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.000
I'm going to make some sugar syrup.

31:41.000 --> 31:42.060
Thank you, Granny.

31:44.680 --> 31:47.410
What does "more sons, more blessings"
even mean?

31:50.200 --> 31:51.640
You are not allowed to have it.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.300
Why?

31:52.750 --> 31:54.240
Could Granny have poisoned it?

31:54.240 --> 31:56.030
Shouldn't you give me some reward for

31:56.030 --> 31:58.160
meeting you in the middle of the night?

31:58.920 --> 32:00.790
What is it, Lord Yan?

32:03.510 --> 32:04.970
There is indeed something

32:05.030 --> 32:06.310
I need you to do for me.

32:08.920 --> 32:10.380
It might require someone.

32:10.920 --> 32:11.400
Who?

32:11.720 --> 32:12.680
Li Congxin.

32:17.680 --> 32:19.880
Please trouble me with something else.

32:20.030 --> 32:23.430
I don't stand a chance with
the Marquis of Danyang household.

32:24.070 --> 32:25.870
Others might not be able to do it.

32:26.110 --> 32:27.880
But with your intelligence

32:28.270 --> 32:30.640
and your relationship with Young Master Li,

32:30.640 --> 32:32.240
isn't this a piece of cake?

32:33.480 --> 32:35.720
I am not close to Young Master Li.

32:37.510 --> 32:38.480
I'm afraid

32:38.880 --> 32:40.480
he wouldn't be up to the task.

32:40.880 --> 32:41.510
Is that so?

32:43.680 --> 32:45.540
When the Xie family was in danger,

32:45.880 --> 32:48.160
your so-called "not close" Young Master Li

32:48.160 --> 32:50.220
came to propose without hesitation.

32:51.830 --> 32:52.510
Forgot?

32:52.880 --> 32:53.880
Even I was moved.

32:58.070 --> 32:59.330
Looking at it this way,

32:59.750 --> 33:02.640
Young Master Li is simple
and straightforward.

33:03.240 --> 33:04.640
He never hides anything.

33:05.240 --> 33:06.640
He is indeed a good match.

33:06.830 --> 33:08.230
At least he is better than

33:09.550 --> 33:12.590
some old foxes who have
a dozen tricks up their sleeves.

33:12.590 --> 33:14.590
Even when we sit down for a cup of tea,

33:14.790 --> 33:18.190
we’re still suspicious of each other
and testing the waters.

33:21.270 --> 33:22.000
Shopkeeper!

33:23.720 --> 33:26.380
What kind of snacks
do you have in the shop today?

33:29.750 --> 33:31.440
Let me have a look.

33:33.640 --> 33:35.590
We have a great variety here.

33:36.200 --> 33:36.880
Sir,

33:37.000 --> 33:37.790
from the sound of it,

33:37.790 --> 33:39.980
you've never been to our shop before.

33:40.590 --> 33:41.180
Not bad.

33:41.920 --> 33:43.850
How long has this shop been opened?

33:44.440 --> 33:46.500
I've been here for half of my life.

33:46.640 --> 33:48.510
Foxes are skilled at
winning people's hearts.

33:48.510 --> 33:50.100
You said I'm a fox.

33:50.960 --> 33:52.180
Have you perhaps

33:52.750 --> 33:53.950
lost something to me?

34:04.110 --> 34:06.710
I've long heard that
your shop has good snacks.

34:08.760 --> 34:10.400
Even the Imperial Advisor, Lord Yan,

34:10.400 --> 34:11.710
comes here often.

34:14.960 --> 34:15.820
Yan Rui, you...

34:17.800 --> 34:19.230
Today, I must see

34:19.230 --> 34:21.290
what's so special about your snacks.

34:21.630 --> 34:24.030
Aren't you afraid your father's colleague

34:24.030 --> 34:27.090
will find out that we met here
in the middle of the night?

34:30.280 --> 34:32.699
We have poria cakes!

34:34.190 --> 34:35.989
Then I'll have some poria cakes.

34:40.230 --> 34:41.130
My Lord!

34:41.320 --> 34:43.150
Poria cakes are in the front hall.

34:43.150 --> 34:43.880
Let's go.

34:43.880 --> 34:45.670
I'll take you to pick more snacks.

34:45.670 --> 34:46.480
You know,

34:46.480 --> 34:49.040
we have many kinds of poria cake,

34:49.190 --> 34:51.000
and even fresh glutinous dumplings.

34:51.000 --> 34:53.230
I'll pick a few nice things for you today.

34:53.230 --> 34:55.830
These are all great picks for
this time of year.

34:56.070 --> 34:57.400
What should I do?

34:58.630 --> 35:00.290
You have a captivating charm.

35:00.880 --> 35:01.800
You give me...

35:03.960 --> 35:05.490
butterflies in my stomach.

35:07.480 --> 35:09.510
You sure talk a lot of nonsense.

35:12.070 --> 35:13.360
They haven't left yet.

35:14.480 --> 35:16.110
You can't wait to leave, huh?

35:17.360 --> 35:17.760
What?

35:19.480 --> 35:20.230
Are you afraid I'll eat you?

35:19.550 --> 35:26.210
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

35:23.230 --> 35:24.920
I'm just your weapon.

35:25.360 --> 35:27.400
Yet, you seem to care so much about
how a weapon feels.

35:26.240 --> 35:33.480
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

35:28.550 --> 35:29.630
Could it be...

35:29.630 --> 35:31.630
that you have other feelings for me?

35:33.500 --> 35:37.380
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

35:35.480 --> 35:37.760
I do have special feelings for you.

35:37.400 --> 35:40.670
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

35:40.700 --> 35:47.580
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

35:47.610 --> 35:55.680
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

35:54.230 --> 35:55.920
If that's your plan,

35:55.700 --> 36:02.190
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

35:57.760 --> 36:00.020
why are you still afraid of Wei Changyan?

36:02.210 --> 36:06.430
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

36:02.320 --> 36:03.980
When have I been afraid of him?

36:06.450 --> 36:09.670
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

36:09.400 --> 36:10.880
Since you call me a fox,

36:09.700 --> 36:16.760
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

36:11.550 --> 36:13.510
I must not disappoint you.

36:14.920 --> 36:16.440
What you just said

36:16.780 --> 36:24.900
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

36:17.030 --> 36:19.320
concerns the safety of
the people of Hengtang.

36:19.320 --> 36:20.850
So of course I'll do my best.

36:21.360 --> 36:22.820
But there's one more thing

36:23.190 --> 36:24.960
I would like to ask for your help.

36:24.960 --> 36:25.630
Go ahead.

36:26.150 --> 36:28.280
I'll do my best to help you too.

36:29.230 --> 36:31.070
Help me find Cui'er,
the drug-testing slave,

36:31.070 --> 36:32.670
who was sold to the Xie family

36:32.800 --> 36:33.590
28 years ago.

36:35.000 --> 36:35.800
You still want to

36:35.800 --> 36:37.460
overturn your mother's case?

36:38.190 --> 36:38.960
I live...

36:39.920 --> 36:41.800
just to clear my mother's name.

36:42.230 --> 36:43.760
I don't mean anything else.

36:46.710 --> 36:47.400
Qingyuan!

36:49.360 --> 36:51.110
Speak of the devil.

36:51.880 --> 36:52.880
Your perfect match is here,

36:52.880 --> 36:53.670
Qingyuan.

36:59.840 --> 37:00.590
Young Master Li.

37:00.590 --> 37:02.710
Zhenglun received premium-grade Yuanhong

37:02.710 --> 37:04.280
and invited me over for a drink.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.680
Would you like to join us?

37:15.280 --> 37:16.480
Is someone else here?

37:21.320 --> 37:22.250
Why are you here?

37:24.440 --> 37:25.500
I came to buy snacks

37:26.150 --> 37:27.760
and ran into her.

37:28.400 --> 37:30.660
She told me
a lot of nice things about you.

37:32.320 --> 37:32.800
Really?

37:33.440 --> 37:34.030
Yes.

37:34.630 --> 37:36.150
So many nice things.

37:36.800 --> 37:37.550
Fourth Lady,

37:38.590 --> 37:40.390
why don't you tell him yourself?

37:42.710 --> 37:43.640
What did you say?

37:46.840 --> 37:47.400
If there is nothing else,

37:47.400 --> 37:48.630
I'll go back with him.

37:50.800 --> 37:51.400
You are in?

37:52.760 --> 37:53.290
Lord Yan,

37:53.880 --> 37:54.520
see you.

37:54.710 --> 37:55.550
Take care.

37:56.070 --> 37:56.800
I'll take it.

37:57.110 --> 37:57.670
No need.

37:59.000 --> 38:00.110
It's okay.

38:00.110 --> 38:00.630
Let me.

38:00.880 --> 38:02.410
Thank you, Young Master Li.

38:12.320 --> 38:13.050
What is that?

38:14.590 --> 38:15.190
It's here!

38:17.550 --> 38:18.680
When did you pick it?

38:20.710 --> 38:22.030
It doesn't matter.

38:22.800 --> 38:23.860
What matters is...

38:36.440 --> 38:38.100
No matter how sweet the candy,

38:38.280 --> 38:40.590
as long as there's someone
you want but can't get,

38:40.590 --> 38:42.880
you taste nothing but bitterness.

38:43.400 --> 38:44.460
You think too much.

38:45.480 --> 38:46.940
I have no feelings for her.

38:48.320 --> 38:50.450
I just want her to do a few things for me.

38:50.800 --> 38:51.670
As for you,

38:52.400 --> 38:53.630
you've been following me all day.

38:53.630 --> 38:54.630
Aren't you tired?

38:54.840 --> 38:56.030
It better be.

38:56.400 --> 38:57.880
If you let your romantic interests

38:57.880 --> 38:59.440
get in the way of our grand plan,

38:59.440 --> 39:01.240
I will definitely kill her first

39:01.630 --> 39:03.230
to prevent future troubles.

39:03.480 --> 39:05.670
You have evidence of Wei Changyan's crimes.

39:05.670 --> 39:07.670
He won't just sit and wait for death.

39:08.000 --> 39:09.480
You don't have any bargaining chips.

39:09.480 --> 39:11.760
Be careful not to fumble over
something unexpected.

39:11.760 --> 39:12.360
Enough.

39:13.320 --> 39:14.030
Tell me.

39:14.510 --> 39:16.110
How are the grain prices now?

39:29.840 --> 39:31.700
I've been at the border for years.

39:31.840 --> 39:33.970
It's rare for me to return to Hengtang.

39:35.280 --> 39:37.880
I never expected to cross paths
with the two of you

39:37.880 --> 39:39.940
and help bring about something good.

39:42.030 --> 39:43.280
Chen's Tea House?

39:43.630 --> 39:46.030
I think the lotus candies given to Qingyuan

39:46.070 --> 39:47.800
may be good as wedding candies.

39:50.630 --> 39:51.760
Actually, that day,

39:51.800 --> 39:54.460
I saw that the Xie family
was in a dire situation.

39:54.630 --> 39:55.550
My rash proposal

39:55.550 --> 39:57.440
was only to force Yan Rui to retreat.

39:57.440 --> 39:58.320
Besides,

39:59.550 --> 40:01.630
I didn't get Qingyuan's agreement.

40:02.960 --> 40:05.090
Let's just treat this matter as a joke.

40:06.510 --> 40:08.240
Since you are so affectionate,

40:08.630 --> 40:09.710
maybe one day,

40:11.030 --> 40:12.360
Qingyuan will be moved.

40:17.110 --> 40:17.910
The two of you,

40:18.030 --> 40:19.560
please don't make fun of me.

40:20.400 --> 40:21.710
I have a lowly status

40:21.880 --> 40:23.800
and wouldn't dare to associate myself
with the Marquis' household.

40:23.800 --> 40:25.760
But you did save me from danger that day.

40:25.760 --> 40:27.880
I will never forget this kindness.

40:29.710 --> 40:31.630
I offer my pure heart with this jade flask.

40:31.630 --> 40:33.550
A toast you, Young Master Li.

40:34.070 --> 40:34.600
Alright.

40:35.360 --> 40:36.590
But please, Qingyuan,

40:36.590 --> 40:39.150
forget my identity from now on,

40:39.590 --> 40:40.650
and forget my name.

40:41.320 --> 40:42.840
Just remember that for you,

40:42.840 --> 40:44.440
my heart is brighter than the moon,

40:44.440 --> 40:45.500
and I'd die for you.

41:01.190 --> 41:02.030
Chunzhi!

41:06.440 --> 41:07.300
Don't drink it.

41:07.590 --> 41:08.450
Second Sister,

41:08.550 --> 41:09.610
What are you doing?

41:10.110 --> 41:11.670
If Baoxian hadn't slipped up

41:11.670 --> 41:13.320
and let me know you were drinking here,

41:13.320 --> 41:14.780
she would have had her way.

41:14.840 --> 41:15.840
Brother Chunzhi,

41:16.000 --> 41:17.930
don't let this bad person fool you.

41:17.960 --> 41:18.820
Second Sister,

41:18.960 --> 41:21.620
why are you attacking
your own family like this?

41:26.960 --> 41:27.820
Second Sister.

41:28.510 --> 41:30.150
I have never lied to you,

41:31.070 --> 41:32.930
nor have I lied to Young Master Li.

41:34.030 --> 41:35.800
Is there some misunderstanding

41:35.800 --> 41:37.360
between you and me?

41:39.400 --> 41:40.530
Misunderstanding?

41:42.550 --> 41:45.680
I really don't want to talk about
the ugly things you did.

41:45.710 --> 41:47.230
Since childhood, everyone knew

41:47.230 --> 41:49.360
that Brother Chunzhi and I
were the closest.

41:49.360 --> 41:51.190
But after you showed up?

41:51.480 --> 41:52.480
He's always on your side

41:52.480 --> 41:53.880
and even wanted to marry you.

41:53.880 --> 41:54.740
Second Sister,

41:54.960 --> 41:56.420
where is this coming from?

41:57.150 --> 41:57.760
I...

41:58.230 --> 41:59.230
My kindness to you

41:59.480 --> 42:00.800
has always been because
I see you as a sibling,

42:00.800 --> 42:02.150
as my own younger sister.

42:02.150 --> 42:05.210
-I truly have feelings for Qingyuan.
-Young Master Li.

42:08.710 --> 42:10.640
I have no intention of interfering

42:10.760 --> 42:14.090
with the relationship between
Second Sister and yourself.

42:14.630 --> 42:17.110
I have overstepped and offended you today.

42:19.800 --> 42:21.360
I apologize to everyone,

42:22.400 --> 42:24.400
and will not disturb you any longer.

42:26.280 --> 42:26.880
Qingyuan!
